OL,3,GNEWSAHospital's maternity unit
OL,4,Acontinuing to improve
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlackpool Victoria Hospital's maternity
OL,7,Fservices are continuing to improve, an
OL,8,FNHS report said, after a critical
OL,9,Finspection last year.
OL,11,FA report by the NHS Trust's Head of
OL,12,FMidwifery and Neonates, Cat Parkinson,
OL,13,Fsaid more than three quarters of the
OL,14,Factions in an 80-point improvement plan
OL,15,Fset out by the Care Quality Commission
OL,16,F(CQC) watchdog had been implemented.
OL,18,FIt said staffing levels had improved
OL,19,Fand no concerns were identified during
OL,20,Fanother CQC visit earlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
