OL,3,GNEWSAHospital's maternity unit
OL,4,Acontinuing to improve
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatient satisfaction remains above 93%,
OL,7,Falthough communication, waiting times
OL,8,Fand discharge delays remain areas
OL,9,Fneeding further improvement.
